    "##### **Notes**\n",
    "\n",
    "1. The drift between 2 sensors appears to be getting worse as we draw closer to colder months - This suggests that one side of the room gets colder relative to the other side. However, more data is needed (Winter months) to determine if this is the case (a pattern should emergy where the difference remains around 2/3 degrees).\n",
